WEBVTT

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:42.740
<b>5: Kitaigen Style</b>

00:01:44.710 --> 00:01:48.070
This concludes the group 2 matches.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:52.350
The group 3 matches will now begin.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.750
Mare versus Ja Seiryan.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.760
<b>Mare</b>

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:54.760
<b>Ja Seiryan</b>

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:57.370
Tou Bunryuu versus Chou Ketsu.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.380
<b>Tou Bunryuu</b>

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.380
<b>Chou Ketsu</b>

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:00.010
<b>Tou Yuufuku</b>

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:00.010
Tou Yuufuku versus Roou.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.010
<b>Roou</b>

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:03.390
<b>Chou Soran</b>

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.780
Chou Soran versus Zen Shidou.

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.390
<b>Zen Shidou</b>

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:17.150
Get him, Zen Shidou!

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.430
Yeah!

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:21.230
Teach that brat a lesson!

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:27.210
I can't believe the group 2 
matches ended so quickly.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.100
Yeah.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:31.660
Fuu Houhou, Chou Reigyoku, and Fuu Shinton.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.410
Everyone you'd expect moved on.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:37.700
Huh? Who fought in the last match?

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.190
I did.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:40.760
Yuki-chan.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.090
Oh, right.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:44.320
It was your match.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:48.230
Didn't you fight against 
Tougousou's Koketsu?

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.390
How'd that go?

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:50.510
I lost.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.340
Really? You lost to Koketsu?

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.650
Did something happen?

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:57.590
It wasn't pretty.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:01.850
At any rate, summon the others.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.420
We need to notify Rikukin at once.

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:11.090
They're awfully fired up.

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:15.360
I thought Soran-kun wasn't that popular.

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:17.960
Yeah, right. He's the center of attention.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:22.750
That shameless boy cheats 
his way through matches.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:26.060
Hey, Dad, Sis.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.330
Did you win too, Shinton?

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:30.950
Yeah, I guess.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:33.370
You came to watch Soran's match?

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:38.660
I thought I'd watch his disgraceful defeat.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.610
Well, he is going up against 
Zen Shidou the Aokami.

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:46.050
Zen Shidou! Zen Shidou!

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.830
Enter the arena immediately!

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.500
Your match has already started!

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.460
Enter the arena immediately!

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.340
What is Zen Shidou doing?

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:55.370
What happened to him?

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:58.030
Maybe Chou Soran cheated again.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.430
It must've been him.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.040
We can't find Zen Shidou anywhere.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.260
What? You can't find him?

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.340
Then we have no choice.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:13.760
Since Zen Shidou failed to enter the arena 
in time for his match, this match is forfeit.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:16.480
Chou Soran wins!

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.600
You cheated again, Chou Soran!

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.560
Heir to the kitaigen style, my ass!

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.920
Fight a proper match!

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.830
Chou Soran!

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.780
Hey, someone entered the arena!

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:36.980
That's the kid Chou Soran 
tricked in his last match!

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:39.340
Chou Soran!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.830
Today's the day I tear off your mask!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.450
Prepare yourself!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.300
Young man, this is no place to fight.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:50.830
Let go of me!

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:51.940
I have to beat him!

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.480
Chou Soran!

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:57.680
If you're a real man, 
fight me fair and square!

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.090
Teehee.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:06.820
Let's go.

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:12.210
Impressive, Soran-kun.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:17.310
I don't know what he did, but I'm 
even more interested in him now.

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:21.760
Dad, do you really like Soran that much?

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.430
Someday you'll realize 
what's so great about him.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.250
Make sure you stay on good terms with him.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.240
That's Chou Soran?

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:38.850
Ro Ji, what do you think?

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:41.700
He's just a boy.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:43.660
What do you think, Ou Ai?

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.970
Should we make contact with him?

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:49.520
Without discussing it with the Tenshi first?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.520
Chou Soran doesn't belong 
to the Tenshifu yet.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:56.900
The Tenshi has no say in this.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:01.660
It's Fuu Chonhao of the Tengekai.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:06.050
To think he stands shoulder to 
shoulder with the Yondai Seika.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.300
Such hubris.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:11.600
What are you talking about?

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.880
The Tengekai is beneath our notice.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.620
They're a bunch of idiots.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:23.940
Thank you for coming, Rikukin-sama.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:30.430
We've gathered everyone who 
isn't currently in a match.

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.380
Shiishe, you're sure?

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:38.820
Yes. When I ate Koketsu's 
ki, I knew immediately.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:45.170
That disgusting flavor belongs 
to Chinchuu the Kakonsha.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.730
The ki of other outsiders 
was mixed in with his, too.

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:52.760
They probably belonged to the 
outsiders Koketsu killed.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:57.380
This is definitely Chinchuu's power: Yamikin.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.890
<b>Yamikin</b>

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:02.140
Chinchuu can lend his power to others.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:08.260
The borrower can absorb the ki of 
other outsiders by killing them.

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:13.720
In exchange for this power, they must 
return a portion of the ki to Chinchuu.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:18.590
However, the more they kill, 
the more their interest rises.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:21.760
Chinchuu's share of the ki increases.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:25.130
The ki the borrower absorbs declines.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:29.320
Eventually he goes mad and 
becomes a simple murderer.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:37.230
How careless of you to wander 
off on your own, Sairoku.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.850
Koketsu, huh?

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:50.320
Looks like Natsuka and Chinchuu 
failed to train their dog properly.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.580
What? Who are you?

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:55.690
Who do you think I am?

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:59.260
Open your eyes and take a good look.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:04.330
Y-Yoku Gadoku of the Hundred Masks?

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:08.750
Shh. I'm not the only one here.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:14.780
I transformed all of them using my power.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:19.030
But unlike me, they can't maintain 
their transformation all the time.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:22.970
It's dispelled if they're distracted.

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:24.160
Listen closely.

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:27.130
Don't act without orders from us.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:31.120
Otherwise, we'll have to erase you.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:49.950
I've made a lot of enemies.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:53.090
Anyway, where's Hou-nee?

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.680
Don't tell me she's burying someone again.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.220
Good grief.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:01.980
Chou Soran-sama.

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:08.350
The Elders Ro Ji-sama and Ou Ai-sama 
request an audience with you.

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:12.260
Huh? But I've never met them.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:15.580
They knew your grandfather.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.440
Come with us.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:21.660
They're waiting for you.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:28.800
Show me the way.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:35.970
We meet again? This must be fate, miss!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:39.830
Let me show you a special treasure 
to celebrate this meeting!

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:40.850
This!

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:43.910
You're still in business?

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:46.080
It's not business.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:49.680
I simply give these treasures 
to those destined to have them.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:55.460
My master acquired this ring after a 
month-long battle with a hundred-tailed fox.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:58.570
Your master fights a lot of monsters.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:01.540
In any case, this treasure is one of a kind!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:04.120
I'll let you have it since you're special!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:06.290
8,000 yuan, no discounts!

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:09.410
But I don't have that much money.

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:12.210
You can pay with credit 
or electronic transfer!

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:15.940
Hurry, miss! You'd better hurry 
before your luck runs out!

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.820
Hold on. I haven't used this in a while.

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:21.350
Let's see... My PIN is...

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:21.870
Huh?

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.930
66666...

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:27.310
Houhou, you didn't watch Soran's match?

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.410
Yeah, I'm good.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.480
I know he'll win.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:44.240
Look... Look... Look... Don't you want it?

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:39.160
Miss, I have a question for you.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.260
Who's your master?

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:44.240
Master? What's a master?

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:47.310
Did your parents train you, then?

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.750
What are your parents' names?

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.290
My parents?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.090
Uh...

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:56.970
I forgot.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:58.840
What? You forgot?

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:01.690
Oh, is Chou Soran's match over?

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:02.840
Where is he?

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:06.400
Soran went somewhere by himself.

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:09.020
Oh, no! Chou Soran is lost!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.770
Chou Soran!

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:13.450
Hey, you. Have you seen Chou Soran?

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.710
No...

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.530
Hey, mister.

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:17.320
Chou Soran, where are you?

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:19.280
Feel like buying this ring for 0.8 yuan?

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.380
No, thank you.

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:24.400
We've brought Chou Soran.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:26.740
Go ahead.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:30.470
These are Elders Ou Ai-sama and Ro Ji-sama.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.780
We finally meet, Chou Soran.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.840
I don't like to beat around the bush.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.170
Give us the kitaigen style.

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:45.720
We'll give you anything you want in return.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:50.020
Come on, quit joking around, gramps.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:53.340
I don't know the kitaigen style.

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:59.140
Zensei demanded the same thing of me 
once, but they failed to acquire anything.

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:05.530
Chou Soran, the kitaigen style will cause 
harm whether you intend it to or not.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:10.200
If you give it to us, 
no one will hurt you anymore.

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:14.080
How can I give you something I don't have?

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:19.230
Boy, we're trying to be polite.

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:23.160
But if you refuse to give it to us...

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:24.660
Ro Kyou!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.350
This is...

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.320
Could it be...

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:32.280
That's Ro Ryou's technique!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:36.500
So you know about Ro Ryou.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:37.820
That's right.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:42.820
This is a secret art that can only be 
learned by the Ro family: Meikon.

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:46.650
It allows us to manipulate your 
soul and extract your memories.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:48.750
What? You and Ro Ryou are—

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:54.040
Yes, he is my great-grandson and 
the younger brother of Ro Kyou.

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:57.450
Great-grandfather, he is not my brother.

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:59.400
He's a degenerate and a heretic.

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:02.770
Uh... What does that mean?

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:06.240
Do you know what Ro Ryou 
did to the Ro family?

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:10.970
That brute harmed my younger sister.

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.480
He killed his own family!

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:17.510
Chou Soran, I want your kitaigen style.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:23.500
I will use that power to kill the 
heretic Ro Ryou and avenge my sister.

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:29.440
I'll confirm whether you actually 
possess the kitaigen style or not.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.400
Please, bro.

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:37.550
Even if I had the kitaigen style, there's 
no way for me to give it to you.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.940
What? Hey, wait!

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:41.700
You're really going to use your Meikon?

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:43.910
A-Anything but that!

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:45.050
Don't worry.

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.950
I'm just going to lightly apply 
my Meikon over your body.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:52.730
It will tell me if you're lying.

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:57.130
<i>Seriously? So it's just a lie detector?</i>

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:58.860
Chou Soran!

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:59.440
Hey, who are you?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.000
Get back, girl!

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:03.220
Who do you think is in here?

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:04.510
I know. Chou Soran.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.470
No!

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:08.120
Ro Ji-sama and Ou Ai-sama are resting in—

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:13.790
Hou-nee.

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:14.830
There you are.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.330
You should've told me you were in trouble.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.340
Who are you?

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:21.410
Why didn't you call me?

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:23.330
<i>How did she find me?</i>

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:24.590
Who are those old farts?

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:28.130
How insolent!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.510
How dare you speak that way to the Elders?!

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:32.620
Hold on!

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.640
Now, now. Ro Kyou-san, calm down.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:40.150
<i>This idiot. She's making things worse.</i>

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:44.180
Fine, Ro Kyou-san. I'll take your test.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:55.490
Don't worry, Hou-nee. I'm fine.

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:58.760
Chou Soran, I'll ask you a question.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:00.670
No, you don't have to ask.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:01.910
I'll tell you.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:07.410
My grandfather never taught 
me the kitaigen style.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:14.230
He didn't tell me anything about it, either.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:19.950
It's the truth.

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:26.860
Very well. Chou Soran, thank you for coming.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.610
You can leave now.

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:30.990
Then I should get going.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:30.990
Wait.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.580
You came all the way here.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:36.620
Let's have a nice, frank chat.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:39.850
<i>Damn it. These old men never give up.</i>

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:41.420
<i>I can't keep fooling them.</i>

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:45.130
Well, if it isn't Ro-sensei and Ou-sensei.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:50.100
What do the Elders want with 
our company's employees?

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:56.840
I just wanted to talk to this Chou Soran 
that everyone's been talking about.

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:59.890
<i>How did they track him here?</i>

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:04.910
I see. Well, he is the center 
of attention right now.

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:06.760
Took you long enough to get here, Jo Yon.

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:09.980
If you're finished, we'll be taking him with us.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.240
Is that all right?

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:12.540
Wait.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:19.980
Chou Soran, don't you want to 
know why your grandfather

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:26.570
left the Tenshifu and went so far as 
to use a false name to hide himself?

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:31.620
He was connected to the heretics of Zensei.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.430
What are you talking about, Ro Ji-san?

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.570
Tell me!

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:41.380
I can't tell you any more.

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:44.400
It's a scandal in the Tenshifu's history.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:51.270
Only the Tenshi himself should 
tell you about this, not me.

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.740
Don't overthink it.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:58.400
They're trying to pit you 
against the Tenshifu.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:03.400
No, the way Ro Ji was acting...
There must be something to what he said.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:08.420
You'll have to win the Raten 
Taishou to learn all the answers.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:12.890
For now you should come up 
with strategies to win.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.960
All the remaining competitors are strong.

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:22.730
Take this!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:33.960
That Kouhin man is a spectacular fire user.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:36.750
He's turned the tables on Shokatsu Sei.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.210
It's the opposite.

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:38.740
Huh?

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:42.670
Shokatsu Sei doesn't consider 
Kouhin his opponent.

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:46.990
That's why he's just running 
around and toying with him.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:51.940
When he finally attacks, 
the match will be over.

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.750
All you're doing is running around.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.910
I wouldn't want to be turned into charcoal.

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:10.700
I liked this outfit.

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.500
How dare you underestimate me?!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.500
Take this! Ryuukadan!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.160
Gon Dobaku!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.030
That's the bukou style's Qimen Dunjia.

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:26.080
I've never seen it before.

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:28.130
Qimen Dunjia?

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:31.930
Your tricks won't work against me!

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:41.030
Take this!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:42.830
Renshou!

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:45.240
Son Kazenawa!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.770
You've got some skill.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:53.660
But...

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:05.980
You changed the temperature of your 
skin to disrupt the flow of my wind.

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:07.210
Not bad.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:11.310
My only specialty is controlling fire.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:13.140
No one can beat me at that.

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:15.880
Retsuenshou!

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.930
Da Kuroruri.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.920
You turned your arms into glass!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:33.490
But how long can you 
withstand my Retsuenshou?

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:35.150
<i>Sure is hot.</i>

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.960
<i>I wonder what temperature his hands are.</i>

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:43.950
You can't run!

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:46.070
Kan Suidan!

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:49.490
What?

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:55.610
<i>Impossible! He erased my flames?</i>

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:59.640
<i>Are his water bolts that powerful?</i>

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:02.960
What's wrong?

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:05.850
No...

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:09.310
<i>My fire is being weakened.</i>

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.350
Kouhin has finally noticed.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.740
Huh? What do you mean?

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.720
The trap of the bukou style's Qimen Dunjia.

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:21.950
The closer he gets to Shokatsu Sei, 
the more trouble he has using his power.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.190
So, uh, in other words...

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:25.740
You don't understand?

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:28.040
Well, you know...

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.420
Didn't your master teach you about tactics?

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:34.430
I understand the basic theory.

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:37.180
He uses formulas to divine his fortune, right?

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:40.330
But his positioning is a mess.

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:42.080
It is.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:46.820
At first glance, his positioning 
doesn't make sense.

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:52.810
With standard Qimen Dunjia, your opponent 
is the center rather than yourself.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:55.890
In other words, they are 
the center of the luopan.

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:59.310
The techniques you can use are determined 
by your opponent's position.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.070
This creates two problems.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:09.210
First, because your opponent is the center, 
you're forced to fight defensively.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:13.160
And second, when you're surrounded 
by multiple opponents,

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:17.510
it becomes incredibly difficult to judge 
the relative bearing of each person.

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:22.470
But Shokatsu Sei fought three opponents 
at once in his previous match.

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:27.470
Yes. That's what makes the bukou 
style's Qimen Dunjia special.

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:32.420
They create a luopan with 
themselves at the center.

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:39.490
Kouhin can back off now, but he's already 
within the luopan that Shokatsu Sei created.

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:42.860
One wrong move, and it's all over.

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:20.540
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:21.970
Impressive Qimen Dunjia, Shokatsu-sensei.

00:23:21.970 --> 00:23:24.160
The Shokatsu family are skilled fighters.

00:23:24.160 --> 00:23:26.250
Could you divine my fortune?

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:28.150
No problem. Let me see.

00:23:28.150 --> 00:23:28.880
I see it!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:30.030
What do you see?

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:31.960
Something good might happen tomorrow.

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:33.710
But it might not.

00:23:33.710 --> 00:23:34.350
Huh?

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:36.220
That'll be 10,000 yuan.

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:38.320
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita -
The Outcast</i>, "Bait."

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>6: Bait</b>

00:23:38.320 --> 00:23:39.550
Don't miss it.
